{"login": "lureka", "location": null, "commits": [{"sha": "2498df7f1102fd85c6736579ec216226825775df", "message": "Review Experiencia section text", "created_at": "2026-03-31T07:13:22Z", "repo": "lurekaweb", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "225541a51172957cc5730502b49ba8f4a3cd6d94", "message": "Review Experiencia section", "created_at": "2026-03-31T07:07:41Z", "repo": "lurekaweb", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "cce69d9af752936de87864bb13f53798cb853201", "message": "The CVs have been reviewed", "created_at": "2026-03-16T10:55:41Z", "repo": "lurekaweb", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ef651fd49ebb508bdaebd004af25d1763bad8b4c", "message": "Remove node_modules from git tracking\n\nnode_modules/ was already in .gitignore but files were previously\ntracked. This removes them from the index without deleting them locally.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-03-11T16:57:10Z", "repo": "lurekaweb", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f40afb1f921f31ea9732ce573cbca3d49ce73597", "message": "Fix Netlify contact form: absolute action path and reCAPTCHA div\n\n- Change action to /success.html (absolute path) to avoid redirect issues\n- Add data-netlify-recaptcha div so Netlify renders the reCAPTCHA widget\n- Add CLAUDE.md with project documentation for Claude Code\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-03-11T16:53:16Z", "repo": "lurekaweb", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e57f435536b76e9afd15bb134a176d4e375a92f8", "message": "Fix build.sh CSS file detection for Vite 6 output\n\nVite generates main-[hash].css (not index-[hash].css) because the\nentry is named 'main' in rollupOptions. With set -e, the failing\nls command was killing the build. Now handles both patterns safely.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-03-11T12:22:03Z", "repo": "lurekaweb", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "83a747b5dc53e786ff12af92e56bcfeb333539f1", "message": "Use npm ci instead of npm install to force clean node_modules\n\nnpm install was reusing a corrupted npm cache where\ndep-D4NMHUTW.js was missing from the vite package.\nnpm ci deletes node_modules entirely before installing,\nbypassing any corrupted cache.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-03-11T12:19:48Z", "repo": "lurekaweb", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "90c91b135f71ef6438be2ebc2e9e4a84f70ddbe9", "message": "Force npm install before build to bypass Netlify node_modules cache\n\nNetlify was reusing a stale cached node_modules with Vite 6.1.x\neven after clearing cache, causing dep-D4NMHUTW.js not found.\nExplicit npm install ensures packages are always freshly resolved.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-03-11T12:15:50Z", "repo": "lurekaweb", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d96ab7db97cca5189ede62c5db76c99050725912", "message": "Regenerate package-lock.json with Vite 6.4.1\n\nThe old lockfile pinned Vite 6.1.x whose internal chunk\ndep-D4NMHUTW.js was not reproducible on Netlify's build\nenvironment, causing ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND on every deploy.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-03-11T12:10:06Z", "repo": "lurekaweb", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3f27291e6c783b74d908e7967ddda98ce88d21a2", "message": "Upgrade Node.js to 20 on Netlify\n\nVite 6.x requires Node 20+ to run correctly. With Node 18,\nan internal chunk file (dep-D4NMHUTW.js) was missing after\nnpm install, causing the build to fail.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-03-11T12:07:00Z", "repo": "lurekaweb", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "93b62fd507fcfa49d66393d44218c698a45843f9", "message": "Add set -e to build.sh to fail fast on Vite errors\n\nWithout set -e, if Vite failed silently, build.sh would continue\nand deploy an incomplete dist/ (missing index.html and assets).\nWith set -e, any failure causes the whole deploy to fail, so\nNetlify preserves the last working deploy instead of deploying\na broken site.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-03-11T12:01:43Z", "repo": "lurekaweb", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ed62f38a0b097a52860943e5ca6148bfd71018ca", "message": "Remove dist/ from git tracking\n\ndist/ is already in .gitignore but files were force-tracked.\nNetlify will now build the full dist/ from scratch on every deploy,\nensuring assets, CSS, and images are always correctly included.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-03-11T11:52:21Z", "repo": "lurekaweb", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "76c3fcd1dd5a508aec7fffb6ee616bc8c456adbb", "message": "Revised CV docs", "created_at": "2026-03-11T11:13:12Z", "repo": "lurekaweb", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1ef7abceb7f24bbd881996cc399072ea0059be1f", "message": "Review CV", "created_at": "2026-02-18T19:06:48Z", "repo": "lurekaweb", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d6e649dd0cd6470c7c33e900990ae94ac921af39", "message": "Review CV document", "created_at": "2026-02-16T13:13:12Z", "repo": "lurekaweb", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2a85ac4aa19443165a7e146523c10e3d3dcbaf29", "message": "Revised text", "created_at": "2026-02-06T18:12:41Z", "repo": "lurekaweb", 